{"unit_id":"KunIsMe__dsh-filescope#card-zh","repo":"KunIsMe/dsh-filescope","commit":"25c5385f42a1802bdc93dc621952650923bfe101","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"FileScope · 文件视界（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：在 DeepSeek Harness 的 Web 页面中浏览工作区目录并预览文件。它通过服务端只读 JSON 路由读取文件系统和工作区注册表，并在侧边栏及会话操作栏提供抽屉入口。主要功能包括按工作区或绝对路径浏览目录、展开目录树、预览文本和二进制文件、检测文件变化后刷新，以及拖动调整抽屉和目录区域大小。适合需要在 DSH Web 会话中查看项目文件的用户。无需 API Key 或外部账号；需要运行在提供文件系统和工作区服务的 Web profile 中。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:164-203","src/client/index.tsx:648-670"]}
{"unit_id":"KunIsMe__dsh-filescope#card-en","repo":"KunIsMe/dsh-filescope","commit":"25c5385f42a1802bdc93dc621952650923bfe101","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"FileScope is a DSH Web plugin for browsing workspace folders and previewing files. Its drawer offers directory navigation, text and binary previews, session workspace following, refresh, and resizing. It uses the Web profile filesystem; no API key or external account is required.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:164-203","src/client/index.tsx:648-670"]}
